and along the muddy base of the corridor.  Between the occasional gnarled
twine of dark wood, pools of murky water litter the gradual northward descent
of the passageway.  To the south, the loose soil rises sharply, peppered with
wet leaves, twigs and the broken remnants of small tree branches.
