three directions.  The hanging roots of the forest above dangle along the
ceiling and weave their way in and out of the walls along the puddle-filled
passage to the south.  To the east the soil seems more solid, keeping a
consistent shape as the corridor drifts towards the dim glow of light.  The
passageway continues downward to the west into glittering darkness, as though
the air itself shimmers at the presence of light.
